cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the data descriptor and the StatMapCorpus dataset."
title: "StatMapCorpus: pipeline, release and validation code"
type: software
version: "1.0.0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/MartaSolarz/StatMapCorpus"
abstract: >-
  Code that built StatMapCorpus, a corpus of 23,549 English-language statistical maps
  from MapPool annotated by thematic map type: a multilingual keyword filter, an image
  classifier trained with active learning, image retrieval, a cascade of vision-language
  model checks with its prompts, the export of the deposited files, and the analyses of
  the technical validation.
